---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHeader from "@/partials/PageHeader.astro";
import bookshelfImage from "@/assets/images/bookshelf-app-temp-thumb.jpg";
import lawnscapingImage from "@/assets/images/lawnscaping-biz-temp-thumb.jpg";
import refreshdImage from "@/assets/images/refreshd-biz-temp-thumb.jpg";
---

<BaseLayout title="Ideas">
  <article class="c-page c-page--single c-page--ideas u-grid">
    <PageHeader
      title="Ideas & projects"
      summary="Showcase of the projects and ideas I'm always thinking about and tinkering with. The guideline is simple: have an idea, share it, build it or talk about it. Like they say, ideas are cheap, execution is everything. And if I don't have time to do it, maybe somebody else will."
    />

    <div class="c-page__body">
      <div class="c-projects-list c-cards-list">
        <div class="c-project c-card c-card--horizontal">
          <div class="c-card__content">
            <h2><a href="/bookshelf" title="Book Shelf">Book Shelf</a></h2>
            <p>Couple of years ago, I decided to start reading more. After a few books I wanted to start 
              keeping track of what I read and what I wanted to read next.</p>
            <p>It started with a simple text file, but once I passed 10 books it became a bit cumbersome. 
              I want to create a something a bit more user-friendly.</p>
            <p>I know, I know, there are a lot of apps out there that do this, but this is my take on it.</p>
          </div>

          <Image class="c-card__image" width={500} src={bookshelfImage} alt="Book Shelf" densities={[1, 2]} />
        </div>

        <div class="c-project c-card c-card--horizontal">
          <div class="c-card__content">
            <h2>Lawnscaping business</h2>
            <p>Yes, I plan on starting a lawnscaping business. I&apos;m not sure when, but I&apos;m sure it will happen.</p>
            <p>Something to do to get away from computers.</p>
          </div>

          <Image class="c-card__image" width={500} src={lawnscapingImage} alt="Lawnscaping business" densities={[1, 2]} />
        </div>

        <div class="c-project c-card c-card--horizontal">
          <div class="c-card__content">                
            <h2>Web development studio</h2>
            <p>Web sites aren&apos;t supposed to be complicated. Business around them shouldn&apos;t be complicated either. Complex, maybe, but not complicated.</p>
            <p>I&apos;m trying to create something simple and straightforward.</p>
          </div>

          <Image class="c-card__image" width={500} src={refreshdImage} alt="Refresh'd studio" densities={[1, 2]} />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
